2: CHARACTERISTICS OF THE POPULATION
2.1 Socio-cultural characteristics of the population
2.1.1 Nationality of the population of Huye district
The results of 5th RPHC-2022 indicate that, the Rwandan population by nationality represent
that 99.11% are Rwandan and 0.89% foreigners. In the Southern Province,99.39% are Rwandan
and 0.61% foreigners.
In Huye district, the Rwandan represent 99.74% (380,926) and foreigners represent 0.26%
(974). Among sectors of Huye District, two out of fourteen have more foreigners compared to
others Ngoma (426) and Tumba (269) As represented in table 2.1.
